  "description": "Please don't cry, my sweet vampire.  \nAs soon as she comes of age, Linnea is married off to an aristocrat in exchange for a sizeable dowry. She finds solace in Aleksis, her new husband's son. However, terrible secrets surrounding the family come to light as soon as they cross the forbidden line. Will she be able to escape from this hell?\n\n[Official English](https://manta.net/series/1958)\n\n***Note:** It's unknown when the Korean release will be announced  \n•This and [The Blood Moon](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=30963215102) are both Manta original webtoons*",
